window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A <i>Highlander's Wounded Heart</i> calls to her…across time. For all fans of <i>Outlander</i>!</p> <p>Fleeing a man in a Scottish castle, American Kate Anderson tumbles into the dungeon. Striking her head, she suffers amnesia and is sent back in time to 1308 where she's rescued by a Highland warrior.</p> <p>Escaped slave Ian Cambel takes Kate to his estate. But as her memories flood back, she's driven to return to the twenty-first century. Helping Kate leave means fighting the invading English troops—and losing a piece of his heart. Will the peace-seeking former gladiator battle his demons and the enemy for a doomed love?</p> <p>Narrated by the award-winning narrator, Audie finalist, and Earphones for excellence in narration winner, Shane East, and Emma Wilder, a classically trained actor and narrator who has worked all over the world on everything from steamy romance novels to Shakespeare.</p>"; 
